{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Start your blazing journey with the first two biomes. All progress will carry over to the full game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In Guards II: Chaos in Hell Demo</strong> you have to defend three lines, swap two of your characters to make your move, plan your strategy turns ahead, and get the most out of the party combinations and characters' abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break through tough challenges, find an approach to different foes, and use anything that may help you, such as upgrades, powerful items, and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show your tactical skills in intense battles by tricky use of the Guards\u2019 abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin the grim journey to Hell here, take down the Devil in a full game. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3152870?t=1748199885","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748199885","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152870/c3e8d8f7e276adf011cea05d6216ca4f94bc88e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748199885","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152870/c3e8d8f7e276adf011cea05d6216ca4f94bc88e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748199885","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Start your blazing journey with the first two biomes. All progress will carry over to the full game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In Guards II: Chaos in Hell Demo</strong> you have to defend three lines, swap two of your characters to make your move,